  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Lobster_Tail?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lobster tail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lobster tail</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal good</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 44</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 201</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 24</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Lobster</span><span title=\"Lobster(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 56</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 8</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lobster tails</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal goods</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 44.\n</p><p>They are used to make <a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di Mare Pizza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Frutti di Mare pizzas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-soup-8445\" title=\"Lobster Soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster soup</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-skewer-15778\" title=\"Lobster Skewer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster skewers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-sushi-8917\" title=\"Lobster Sushi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster sushi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/seafood-salad-8948\" title=\"Seafood Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">seafood salad</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster pasta</a>.\n</p><p>Like all goods, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Trapping lobsters</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Lobster_Trap_Full.png/revision/latest?cb=20140920144719\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A trapped lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A trapped lobster\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"113\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A trapped lobster</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Lobsters can only be caught in <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster traps</a>. Only 1 lobster is caught per trap. It takes 6 hours to catch a lobster after the trap has been placed into the water. Players can speed this up by spending 8 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Collecting lobster tails</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/97/Lobster_Pool_Stage_6.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713113630\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The Lobster Pool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The Lobster Pool\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The Lobster Pool</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Lobster tails are collected from <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobsters</a> which have been put in the <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pool-8477\" title=\"Lobster Pool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pool</a>. Once caught, each lobster needs to stay in the pool for 6 hours to yield a tail. Players can speed this up by spending 8 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.\n</p><p>Collecting a tail gives players 24 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling lobster tails</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Lobster tails can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,016 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 tails.</li>\n<li>Making <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster traps</a> does not require any material and does not cost anything.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using lobster tails</b></span></h3>\n<p>Lobster tails are used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di mare pizza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Frutti di mare pizza\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-soup-8445\" title=\"Lobster soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster soup\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-skewer-15778\" title=\"Lobster skewer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster skewer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di Mare Pizza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Frutti di Mare Pizza</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-soup-8445\" title=\"Lobster Soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Soup</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-skewer-15778\" title=\"Lobster Skewer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Skewer</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 45\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 46\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 48\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-sushi-8917\" title=\"Lobster sushi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster sushi\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/seafood-salad-8948\" title=\"Seafood salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Seafood salad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-sushi-8917\" title=\"Lobster Sushi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Sushi</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/seafood-salad-8948\" title=\"Seafood Salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Seafood Salad</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pasta-20285\" title=\"Lobster Pasta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pasta</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5d/Lobster_Tail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150411101115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lobster Tail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 59\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 64\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 79\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 2 to 4 lobster tails per crate, up to a total of 16 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Catching a lobster requires making a <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-trap-17084\" title=\"Lobster Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lobster trap</a> (2 h) then letting it sit in the water for 6 hours.</li>\n<li>Recipes ask between 1 and 2 tails.</li>\n<li>Lobster tails are so rare that selling them at maximum price is recommended.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-w